{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C1与C2内容完全相同，并列第一；它们最完整地接住前段的满足、现实未变、重新面对行动压力和迟疑加深，C4次之，C3则牺牲了部分因果细节。keep：C1/C2既保留了安宁真实却未实现、怀念无法护住珍惜之物、重新投入时害怕耗损温柔，也明确写出原以为理由足够就能安心、如今理由更多反而更难决定，C4虽更清楚写出进退两难，却弱化了理由增加这一层。cover：C1/C2从熟悉的亲近、身体先紧绷到发现现实未变，能解释突然惊醒和熟悉生活闯入的感觉，末条又以理由增多、无法定下来承接持续盘旋的紧张，C4对熟悉感的突然浮现也很有效。lean：C3用较少的心理步骤完成了回忆旧理由、害怕行动耗损温柔、迟疑加深的推进，C1/C2略有解释过多，C4末条又把前两条的两种风险重新复述了一遍。plain：C1/C2的“怎么又沉进去”和“光在心里想着那种生活也护不住它们”最像一个人在回想自己的经历，C4也比较直接，但部分句子带有归纳解释的味道，C3的“顾虑也不是没道理”则稍显抽象。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d78ed6f3-cf2c-4d73-9626-50b816dd7d7b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T005505338895Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.843, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:55:51.196433+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e3c3c5dc793f9427bab15d00644a1cc78be7fe1bf3ea7072a8a134d5fece3c45", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "at